---
layout: base.njk
---

<!-- HEADER -->
<header class="fixed top-0 inset-x-0 z-50 backdrop-blur-md bg-ink/75 border-b border-line/60">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 h-[72px] md:h-[80px] flex items-center justify-between">
    <a href="#top" class="flex items-center gap-3 group" aria-label="nisslar">
      <img src="/assets/favicon.png" alt="" class="h-8 w-8 md:h-9 md:w-9 rounded-md" />
      <span class="font-serif text-[22px] md:text-[26px] leading-none tracking-tightest text-cream whitespace-nowrap">
        nisslar
      </span>
    </a>

    <nav class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-9 text-[15px] tracking-[0.04em] text-cream/75">
      <a href="#top" class="hover:text-cream transition lnk" data-i18n="nav.home">Ana Sayfa</a>
      <a href="#fleet" class="hover:text-cream transition lnk" data-i18n="nav.fleet">Filo</a>
      <a href="#about" class="hover:text-cream transition lnk" data-i18n="nav.about">Hakkımızda</a>
      <a href="#faq" class="hover:text-cream transition lnk" data-i18n="nav.faq">SSS</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 md:gap-5">
      <!-- TR / EN -->
      <div class="lang-track flex items-center p-1 rounded-full border border-line bg-ink2/60" data-lang="tr">
        <span class="lang-slider"></span>
        <button type="button" class="lang-pill flex items-center gap-1 md:gap-1.5 px-2.5 md:px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[10px] md:text-[11px] font-medium tracking-[0.14em]" data-lang="tr">TR</button>
        <button type="button" class="lang-pill flex items-center gap-1 md:gap-1.5 px-2.5 md:px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[10px] md:text-[11px] font-medium tracking-[0.14em]" data-lang="en">EN</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Theme toggle -->
      <button id="theme-toggle" class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center text-cream/70 hover:text-gold transition" aria-label="Tema değiştir">
        <svg id="icon-sun" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-[18px] h-[18px]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/><path d="M12 1v2M12 21v2M4.22 4.22l1.42 1.42M18.36 18.36l1.42 1.42M1 12h2M21 12h2M4.22 19.78l1.42-1.42M18.36 5.64l1.42-1.42"/></svg>
        <svg id="icon-moon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-[18px] h-[18px] hidden" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79z"/></svg>
      </button>

      <a href="https://turo.com/us/en/host/51476329" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hidden md:inline-flex group items-center gap-2.5 bg-gold text-ink hover:bg-goldhi transition px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-[11.5px] font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase">
        <span data-i18n="nav.book">Rezerve Et</span>
        <span class="arr -mr-0.5">→</span>
      </a>

      <!-- Hamburger -->
      <button class="hamburger md:hidden flex flex-col gap-[5px] w-7 h-7 justify-center items-center" aria-label="Menü">
        <span class="block w-5 h-[1.5px] bg-cream"></span>
        <span class="block w-5 h-[1.5px] bg-cream"></span>
        <span class="block w-5 h-[1.5px] bg-cream"></span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- Mobile Menu -->
<div class="mobile-menu fixed inset-0 z-40 bg-ink/98 backdrop-blur-lg flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-8 md:hidden">
  <a href="#top" class="mobile-link text-cream text-[18px] font-serif tracking-tightest" data-i18n="nav.home">Ana Sayfa</a>
  <a href="#fleet" class="mobile-link text-cream text-[18px] font-serif tracking-tightest" data-i18n="nav.fleet">Filo</a>
  <a href="#about" class="mobile-link text-cream text-[18px] font-serif tracking-tightest" data-i18n="nav.about">Hakkımızda</a>
  <a href="#faq" class="mobile-link text-cream text-[18px] font-serif tracking-tightest" data-i18n="nav.faq">SSS</a>
  <a href="https://turo.com/us/en/host/51476329" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="mt-4 group inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 bg-gold text-ink hover:bg-goldhi transition px-7 py-3 rounded-full text-[12px] font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase">
    <span data-i18n="nav.book">Rezerve Et</span>
    <span class="arr">→</span>
  </a>
</div>

<!-- HERO -->
<section id="top" class="relative pt-[72px] md:pt-[80px]">
  <div class="relative h-[600px] md:h-[820px] overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Video background -->
    <video class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover" autoplay muted loop playsinline>
      <source src="/assets/background.mp4" type="video/mp4"/>
    </video>
    <div class="hero-overlay absolute inset-0"></div>

    <div class="relative max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 h-full flex items-center z-10">
      <div class="max-w-[820px] md:pl-12">
        <div class="reveal flex items-center gap-4 mb-6 md:mb-8">
          <span class="mono-lbl text-gold uppercase" data-i18n="hero.eyebrow">Miami · Lüks Filo</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="reveal font-serif text-[clamp(42px,7.4vw,108px)] leading-[0.92] tracking-tightest text-cream balance">
          <span data-i18n="hero.title1">Sürüş değil,</span><br/>
          <span class="italic font-light text-cream/95" data-i18n="hero.title2">bir <span class="text-gold not-italic font-normal">deneyim</span>.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="reveal mt-6 md:mt-8 max-w-[480px] text-[14px] md:text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-cream/65 pretty" data-i18n="hero.sub">
          Miami sokaklarında, özenle seçilmiş bir filo. Sigorta dahil, gizli ücret yok — yalnız siz, anahtarlar ve yol.
        </p>
        <div class="reveal mt-8 md:mt-11 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-3">
          <a href="#fleet" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-cream text-ink hover:bg-white transition px-7 py-3.5 text-[11.5px] font-semibold tracking-[0.22em] uppercase">
            <span data-i18n="hero.cta1">Araçları Gör</span>
            <span class="arr">→</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://turo.com/us/en/host/51476329" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-3 border border-cream/25 hover:border-gold hover:text-gold text-cream px-7 py-3.5 text-[11.5px] font-semibold tracking-[0.22em] uppercase transition">
            <span data-i18n="hero.cta2">Rezerve Et</span>
            <span class="arr">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 border-t border-line/80 bg-ink/40 backdrop-blur-sm z-10">
      <div class="marquee py-3 md:py-4">
        <div id="marquee-track" class="marquee-track mono-lbl text-cream/40 whitespace-nowrap"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- TRUST STRIP -->
<section class="border-b border-line bg-ink">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 py-14 md:py-20 grid grid-cols-12 gap-8">
    <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-3 reveal">
      <div class="mono-lbl text-gold uppercase" data-i18n="trust.eyebrow">— Söz</div>
      <p class="mt-3 font-serif italic text-[20px] md:text-[22px] leading-snug text-cream/85 pretty" data-i18n="trust.lead">
        Üç söz veriyoruz, üçünü de tutuyoruz.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-9 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 lg:divide-x lg:divide-line">
      {% for item in siteContent.trust.items %}
      <div class="reveal py-2 lg:px-10 {% if loop.first %}first:lg:pl-0{% endif %}">
        <div class="mono-lbl text-cream/35">0{{ loop.index }}</div>
        <h3 class="mt-3 font-serif text-[24px] md:text-[28px] leading-tight text-cream" data-i18n="trust.t{{ loop.index }}">{{ item.title.tr }}</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-cream/55 pretty" data-i18n="trust.s{{ loop.index }}">{{ item.desc.tr }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FLEET -->
<section id="fleet" class="relative py-16 md:py-28 border-b border-line">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-end mb-12 md:mb-16 reveal">
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-7">
        <div class="mono-lbl text-gold uppercase mb-4">— <span data-i18n="fleet.eyebrow">Filo</span></div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-[clamp(40px,5.4vw,80px)] leading-[0.96] tracking-tightest text-cream balance">
          <span data-i18n="fleet.title1">Az,</span> <span class="italic font-light text-cream/80" data-i18n="fleet.title2">ama</span> <span class="text-gold italic font-light" data-i18n="fleet.title3">özenli</span>.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-5 lg:text-right">
        <p class="text-[14px] text-cream/55 max-w-[360px] lg:ml-auto pretty mb-4" data-i18n="fleet.desc">
          Her araç bizzat seçildi. Detaylı temizlik, tam yakıt, anahtar elden teslim — başka türlüsü olmaz.
        </p>
        <a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[11.5px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-cream/85 hover:text-gold transition lnk">
          <span data-i18n="fleet.all">Tüm Filoyu Gör</span>
          <span class="arr">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="fleet-grid" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-x-7 gap-y-10 md:gap-y-14"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ABOUT -->
<section id="about" class="relative py-20 md:py-32 border-b border-line bg-ink2/40 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-6 md:gap-10 items-start">
    <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-5 reveal">
      <div class="relative w-full max-w-full aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden border border-line">
        <img id="about-img" src="/assets/about.jpg" alt="Miami" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover"/>
        <span class="absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-[1px] bg-gold"></span>
        <span class="absolute left-0 top-0 w-[1px] h-8 bg-gold"></span>
        <span class="absolute right-0 bottom-0 w-8 h-[1px] bg-gold"></span>
        <span class="absolute right-0 bottom-0 w-[1px] h-8 bg-gold"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-7 lg:pl-8 reveal">
      <div class="mono-lbl text-gold uppercase mb-4">— <span data-i18n="about.eyebrow">Hakkımızda</span></div>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-[clamp(36px,4.8vw,72px)] leading-[0.98] tracking-tightest text-cream balance">
        <span data-i18n="about.title1">Miami'de,</span><br/>
        <span class="italic font-light text-cream/90" data-i18n="about.title2">sessiz bir <span class="text-gold not-italic font-normal">lüks</span>.</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-8 md:mt-10 pl-6 border-l border-gold/50">
        <p class="font-serif italic text-[20px] md:text-[24px] leading-snug text-cream/85 max-w-[520px] pretty" data-i18n="about.quote">
          "Filomuzu büyütmek değil, derinleştirmek istedik. Her araç tek tek seçildi — sayı değil, sürüş önemli."
        </p>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-8 max-w-[560px] text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-cream/60 pretty" data-i18n="about.p1">
        2018'den bu yana Miami'de butik bir araç deneyimi sunuyoruz. Brickell'deki küçük garajımızdan başlayan iş; bugün özenle bakılan 42 araç ve elden yapılan binlerce teslimata dönüştü. Büyümek isteseydik çoktan büyürdük — biz iyi kalmayı seçtik.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FAQ -->
<section id="faq" class="relative py-16 md:py-28 border-b border-line">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-10">
    <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-4 reveal">
      <div class="mono-lbl text-gold uppercase mb-4">— <span data-i18n="faq.eyebrow">Sıkça Sorulanlar</span></div>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-[clamp(36px,4.6vw,68px)] leading-[0.96] tracking-tightest text-cream balance">
        <span data-i18n="faq.title1">Önce</span><br/>
        <span class="italic font-light text-gold" data-i18n="faq.title2">cevaplar</span>.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-[14px] text-cream/55 max-w-[280px] pretty" data-i18n="faq.desc">
        Aklınızdaki soruları çoktan duyduk. Eksik kalan varsa, concierge bir mesaj uzağınızda.
      </p>
      <a id="faq-email" href="mailto:hello@nisslar.com" class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[11.5px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-cream/85 hover:text-gold transition lnk">
        <span data-i18n="faq.contact">Bize Yazın</span>
        <span class="arr">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <div id="faq-list" class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-8 reveal divide-y divide-line border-y border-line"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FOOTER -->
