      <div class="font-serif text-[clamp(60px,15vw,220px)] leading-[0.85] tracking-tightest text-cream whitespace-nowrap">
        nisslar<span class="text-gold">.</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 md:gap-10 pb-12 md:pb-16">
      <div class="col-span-2 md:col-span-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
          <img src="/assets/favicon.png" alt="" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-md" />
          <span class="font-serif text-[24px] leading-none tracking-tightest text-cream whitespace-nowrap">
            nisslar
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-cream/55 max-w-[300px] pretty" data-i18n="footer.about">
          Miami merkezli, butik lüks araç kiralama. 2018'den beri özenle.
        </p>
        <div id="footer-socials" class="mt-6 md:mt-8 flex items-center gap-3"></div>
